{"id":"vod_sn_38570","vodId":"38570","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"白色相簿第二季","name_cn":"白色相簿第二季","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/53e15ec9f58d8ed034db663b70d3ef63.jpg"},"summary":"时值2007年的秋天，北原春希（水岛大宙 配音）是一位就读于峰城大学附属学园的平凡高中三年级学生，为了替自己的高中生活划下完美的句号，春希加入了轻音乐同好社团。可是，惨淡的经营让这个本就默默无闻的社团几近崩溃，春希的美好愿望眼看着就要破灭。　　一次偶然中，正在独自弹奏吉他的春希突然听到一段美妙的歌声，追寻着这声音，一个名叫小木曽雪菜（米泽円 配音）的女生出现在了春希的面前。雪菜是学校里的偶像人物，之后，雪菜经由春希的邀请加入了轻音部。紧接着加入的是能够弹奏一手好钢琴的女生冬马和纱（生天目仁美 配音），和纱的叛逆和不羁人尽皆知，可即便如此，春希还是热忱地邀请了和纱“入伙”。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:02:44","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/822FrreTN91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rgvny6kYF41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Du9wJg84Sn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tGA8DY4Ujn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gF02xNV9Se1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NrT5mGmXAk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wnVgiXs5mJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Jk5cLhEvvp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RGRT4vsAWn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DwtqRrcuL81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Rpt9b45Baf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/J1jPHMHmFi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Uxg3ZEG2ms1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:57.119Z"}